test_mcp_docker	Build and push	2026-10-22T14:30:00.4535882Z             "body": "This draft preserves the original local stdio MCP and adds a bounded batch/job engine, private profiles/artifacts, production packaging, lifecycle checks, and native regression evidence. Release acceptance remains blocked.\n\nThe current candidate fixes pinned VP9 recording metadata by adding BT.709 primaries alongside the existing smpte170m matrix. Native87 Mac WebKit changed from red [248,37,0,255] to [255,2,0,255] in metadata-only controls with identical encoded stream bytes. The producer change still needs native88 verification. Owned WAV/WebM fixtures now support exact single byte ranges and HEAD; their assertions and deadlines remain unchanged. Failed scoped process audits now retain the existing full observation and same-snapshot birth/row evidence before asserting.\n\nLocal validation: strict TypeScript, README generation and actionlint pass (shellcheck/pyflakes disabled); actual PCM/video4/4 each Node20/22/24; fresh297-file scripts-disabled production install and original/batch/jobs/journal/guardian smokes pass. Prepared core SHA256: 3eb68a089871529d6dccd723546bc87e20299047e140d382dc5fe380b1350192.\n\nNative87 at b279f0d: completed summaries1913 passes/9 failures, plus94 Node20 main passing receipts before the unchanged30m job limit (excluded from completed totals). All five installed-package checks and17 log reads completed. Mac1k deadlines, Windows Firefox/input/cleanup, WebKit media, and Mac source screenshot failures remain. One Windows supervised Firefox scoped observation lacks recovered private row/birth details; it remains unresolved. Historical136/142 PID debt and unconfirmed exits are not cleared by healthy samples or filters.\n\nNative88 candidate702b616:\n- [Local batch QA](https://github.com/timmiballz22/playwright-mcp/actions/runs/39788239513)\n- [Original CI](https://github.com/timmiballz22/playwright-mcp/actions/runs/39788239509)\n\nFull scope, failures and evidence are in docs/CODEX_EXECUTION_REPORT.md and docs/evidence/native87-summary.json. No release, merge, publishing, force click, transport-default change, raised test limit, or ownership-debt waiver is included.\n",
